<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Experimental results for self-supervised representation learning. We report the ROC - AUC ( % ) for the graph classification task and RMSE ( <math id="S5.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">⇓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Downarrow</annotation></semantics></math> ) for the graph regression task. “<math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">⇓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>" indicates that lower RMSE values correspond to better model performance. SSTAG and other self-supervised benchmarks are pretrained on ogbn-Paper100M and then evaluated on individual target datasets.</figcaption>
